From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bornaradusin <bornaradusin@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 21:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 116/116] PC5: surround sound, 5.1 or 7.1, for a game that asks (Wine
 patch 0949)

A game's Sound output in PC5 sets WINE_PS5_SPEAKERS: 6 or 8 offers games a
5.1 or 7.1 mix format and speakers, the mixer routes each channel to its own
speaker instead of folding to stereo, and the title opens the console's port
in 8 channels. If the console refuses 7.1 it plays stereo as before. mmdevapi
now takes the driver's speakers each run, so DirectSound games see them too.
---
