-- Its mix format is 48 kHz float stereo. A stream may use any PCM or float
+- Its mix format is 48 kHz float stereo, or 5.1 or 7.1 when the title sets
+  `WINE_PS5_SPEAKERS` to 6 or 8 (a game's Sound output in PC5); its
+  PhysicalSpeakers say the same (patch 0949). A stream may use any PCM or float
